  "body": "**This change fixes a very trivial editorial mistake.**\n\nThe `itemtype` attribute value in the _turnout lantern retrofit kit_ [example](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/microdata.html#items) does not line up, unlike the prior _locomotive_ example. This pull requests inserts an extra space that makes the example line up.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5781/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 5, 2020, 2:15 PM UTC (b240481)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5781/230af41...b240481/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 5, 2020, 2:15 PM UTC (b240481)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5781/microdata.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 5, 2020, 2:15 PM UTC (b240481)\">/microdata.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5781/230af41...b240481/microdata.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 5, 2020, 2:15 PM UTC (b240481)\">diff</a> )",
